box2d
------------------------------------------
Box2D is an open source C++ engine for simulating rigid bodies in 2D.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libbox2d-devel-3.2.0-1bl1
  libbox2d3-3.2.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://box2d.org/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/erincatto/box2d/archive/refs/tags/v3.2.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack box2d-3.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./box2d-3.2.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/box2d-3.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/box2d-3.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbox2d3-3.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbox2d-devel-3.2.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(box2d)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/box2d.README
  /usr/share/doc/box2d/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/box2d/README.md

(libbox2d3)
  /usr/bin/cygbox2d-3.dll

(libbox2d-devel)
  /usr/include/box2d/base.h
  /usr/include/box2d/box2d.h
  /usr/include/box2d/collision.h
  /usr/include/box2d/config.h
  /usr/include/box2d/constants.h
  /usr/include/box2d/id.h
  /usr/include/box2d/math_functions.h
  /usr/include/box2d/math_types.h
  /usr/include/box2d/types.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/box2d/box2dConfig-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/box2d/box2dConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/box2d/box2dConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/libbox2d.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/box2d.pc

